{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1779633741480,"sessionID":"ses_1a59037d3ffe3jlshpo7nzCFpL","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"skill","callID":"019e5a6fdb824422020fce6091ec9c09","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"name":"agent-workbench-feature-zh"},"output":"<skill_content name=\"agent-workbench-feature-zh\">\n# Skill: agent-workbench-feature-zh\n\n# Agent Workbench 功能开发（中文）\n\n用户要求新增、修改或验证固件行为时使用本 workflow：外设、CLI 命令、协议、状态逻辑、控制环路、状态上报，或“实现并验证”类工作。始终与 `agent-workbench-toolbox-zh` 配合使用。\n\n## 功能开发流程\n\n1. 运行 `doctor --json`，阻塞性失败先报告。\n2. 读取当前 `agent_workbench/agent_workbench.yaml`、README/配置、相关源码、生成头文件、linker/map、ELF symbols 和已有 runtime artifacts。\n3. 从当前项目确认 ready banner、prompt、CLI 命令、source dirs、artifact、串口、flash 方法和 monitor/remote-dt 可用性；不要复用示例值。\n4. 把需求拆成控制入口、状态变化、硬件资源、可观测证据和回归风险。\n5. 做最小且完整的固件修改；生成代码优先在 USER CODE 或项目已采用的安全区域修改。\n6. 运行 `build --json`；普通编译/链接失败才运行 `fix-build --json`，最多 3 轮。\n7. 需要板上证据时运行 `flash --json`，必要时 `reset --json`。\n8. 用 `uart exec --reset-first --expect-ready --json` 或 `diag exec --json` 验证用户可见行为。\n9. 需要内部状态、寄存器、计数器或趋势证据时，自动修改 monitor YAML，运行 `monitor start` -> 触发行为 -> `monitor stop` -> `monitor stats`。\n10. 需要远端 Linux/覆盖率/远程设备测试时，运行相应 `remote-dt ... --json`。\n11. 按 [references/feature-report-template.md](references/feature-report-template.md) 输出功能报告。\n\n## 按需读取\n\n- 标准开发路径：[references/feature-flow.md](references/feature-flow.md)\n- 实现方法论：[references/feature-development-methodology.md](references/feature-development-methodology.md)\n- 验收模式：[references/feature-acceptance-patterns.md](references/feature-acceptance-patterns.md)\n- 报告模板：[references/feature-report-template.md](references/feature-report-template.md)\n- monitor 配置：`agent-workbench-toolbox-zh/references/monitor-configuration.md`\n\n## 完成标准\n\n功能不是 build 通过就完成。最终报告必须说明：\n\n- 修改了什么。\n- 为什么修改匹配当前项目的硬件和软件结构。\n- build 是否通过。\n- 是否通过 UART/diag/monitor/remote-dt 获得合适证据。\n- 涉及 CLI 时 ready/prompt 和命令响应是否稳定。\n- 涉及内部状态时是否有 monitor 样本或明确阻塞原因。\n- 剩余风险和精确 evidence 路径。\n\nBase directory for this skill: file:///C:/Users/Administrator/.config/opencode/skills/agent-workbench-feature-zh\nRelative paths in this skill (e.g., scripts/, reference/) are relative to this base directory.\nNote: file list is sampled.\n\n<skill_files>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-feature-zh\\references\\feature-report-template.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-feature-zh\\references\\feature-flow.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-feature-zh\\references\\feature-development-methodology.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-feature-zh\\references\\feature-acceptance-patterns.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-feature-zh\\agents\\openai.yaml</file>\n</skill_files>\n</skill_content>","metadata":{"name":"agent-workbench-feature-zh","dir":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-feature-zh","truncated":false},"title":"Loaded skill: agent-workbench-feature-zh","time":{"start":1779633741409,"end":1779633741478}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"用户要求在STM32项目中实现一个CLI指令，通过主循环来实现红灯闪烁，闪烁频率是0.5ms一次。\n\n根据任务描述，这是一个典型的STM32功能开发任务，需要：\n1. 新增CLI指令\n2. 实现红灯控制逻辑\n3. 在主循环中处理闪烁\n4. 0.5ms的闪烁周期\n\n这符合 `agent-workbench-feature-zh` skill 的使用场景。\n\n首先我需要：\n1. 运行 doctor 检查项目状态\n2. 查看现有CLI实现\n3. 了解LED GPIO配置\n4. 实现CLI指令和闪烁逻辑\n5. 构建并验证\n\n让我先加载feature skill，然后开始执行。","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_e5a6fdc6d001QLJqupxilehz60","sessionID":"ses_1a59037d3ffe3jlshpo7nzCFpL","messageID":"msg_e5a6fc9430018Dp1Jo1g6hhr1T"}}
